# Define baseUrl and accessToken in a local HTTP-client environment; do not commit tokens.

### Search within the Valencia map area
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?query=Col%C3%B3n&latitude=39.47&longitude=-0.376&boundingBox=-0.44,39.42,-0.30,39.52&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search nearby pharmacies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?category=pharmacy&latitude=39.47&longitude=-0.376&radiusKilometers=3&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reject conflicting search modes (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?query=pharmacy&category=pharmacy&latitude=39.47&longitude=-0.376
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reject missing pharmacy center (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?category=pharmacy
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reject invalid limit (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?query=Valencia&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Require authentication (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/places/search?query=Valencia
